00:07:55.112 --> 00:07:56.180
CLASSMATE, SECRETARY ESPER, WAS

00:07:56.181 --> 00:07:56.597
FIRED.

00:07:56.598 --> 00:07:57.383
WERE YOU?

00:07:57.417 --> 00:08:00.307
&gt;&gt; MARK IS A GOOD FRIEND AND

00:08:00.342 --> 00:08:02.309
MARK HAS SERVED THIS NATION.

00:08:02.311 --> 00:08:04.619
WHEN WE WERE CADETS AND HIS TIME

00:08:04.653 --> 00:08:05.799
IN UNIFORM, I WISH HIM WELL.

00:08:05.834 --> 00:08:07.946
THE PRESIDENT GETS TO CHOOSE THE

00:08:07.947 --> 00:08:08.980
FOLKS HE WANTS TO SERVE.

00:08:09.014 --> 00:08:11.613
I WILL LEAVE IT THERE OTHER THAN

00:08:11.615 --> 00:08:13.703
TO SAY I’M PROUD OF THE WORK

00:08:13.738 --> 00:08:15.190
THAT THE ENTIRE TEAM THAT THE

00:08:15.224 --> 00:08:16.265
PRESIDENT HAS HAD FOR MY FOUR

00:08:16.266 --> 00:08:17.467
YEARS HAS ACCOMPLISHED.

00:08:17.502 --> 00:08:19.211
HOPEFULLY WE HAVE MORE TIME TO

00:08:19.245 --> 00:08:20.734
CONTINUE TO WORK TO KEEP

00:08:20.735 --> 00:08:21.550
AMERICANS SAFE.

00:08:21.584 --> 00:08:23.944
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU FOUGHT TO HAVE

00:08:23.979 --> 00:08:24.921
GINA HASPEL AT CIA.

00:08:24.955 --> 00:08:25.806
THE FBI DIRECTOR CURRENTLY.

00:08:25.807 --> 00:08:27.165
DO YOU THINK THE PRESIDENT IS

00:08:27.166 --> 00:08:28.070
GOING TO MAKE CHANGES THERE AS

00:08:28.071 --> 00:08:28.506
WELL?

00:08:28.507 --> 00:08:30.220
&gt;&gt; I WILL LEAVE THOSE DECISIONS

00:08:30.255 --> 00:08:32.107
ABOUT PEOPLE TO THE PRESIDENT.

00:08:32.108 --> 00:08:33.113
I’M FOCUSED ON THE MISSION.

00:08:33.148 --> 00:08:35.407
I AM FOCUSED ON WORKING WITH THE

00:08:35.442 --> 00:08:36.768
TEAM TO MAKE SURE WE DELIVER ON

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:38.426
BEHALF OF THE AMERICAN PEOPLE.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.181
&gt;&gt; Bret: OKAY.

00:08:40.215 --> 00:08:41.949
LAST THING, 2024.

00:08:41.983 --> 00:08:43.758
DO YOU HAVE ASPIRATIONS

00:08:43.792 --> 00:08:45.468
POLITICALLY EITHER AT THE

00:08:45.469 --> 00:08:47.603
HIGHEST OFFICE IN THE LAND OR A

00:08:47.604 --> 00:08:49.191
CERTAIN KANSAS SENATE SEAT THAT

00:08:49.192 --> 00:08:50.427
MAY COME OPEN?

00:08:50.428 --> 00:08:52.053
&gt;&gt; BRET, YOU KNOW ME BETTER THAN

00:08:52.055 --> 00:08:52.648
THAT.

00:08:52.683 --> 00:08:54.117
I APPRECIATE YOU ASKING.

00:08:54.119 --> 00:08:56.753
I AM FOCUSED ON WHAT I’M DOING

00:08:56.754 --> 00:08:57.950
TODAY.

00:08:57.952 --> 00:08:59.999
I’LL KEEP AT IT.

